{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Livestream Legend!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Content King</i>, you step into the shoes of Caden Brentley, an aspiring young content creator who\u2019s taken livestreaming to the extreme: broadcasting his entire life. With the goal of becoming the biggest streamer of all time, you must pursue clout by any means necessary. Interact with characters, start drama with streamers, complete quests, and stir up mischief to boost your view count and climb the ranks of internet fame.   <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/7a56c80a6111ed0bdb22ce8ee3cdb3bc.poster.avif?t=1760038553\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/7a56c80a6111ed0bdb22ce8ee3cdb3bc.webm?t=1760038553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/7a56c80a6111ed0bdb22ce8ee3cdb3bc.mp4?t=1760038553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact with Everybody!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless characters voiced by real streamers, every interaction brings new drama, new dialogue, and new choices. Will you help them\u2026 or simply use them for content?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/d32b054f829a447ca27515d5ad4ac5d8.poster.avif?t=1760038553\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/d32b054f829a447ca27515d5ad4ac5d8.webm?t=1760038553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything\u2019s Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of minigames and explore an open sandbox world. In <i>Content King</i>, everything is an opportunity to entertain the chat and get new viewers!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/18b8d36618766453cc48966caa8a5cc0.poster.avif?t=1760038553\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/18b8d36618766453cc48966caa8a5cc0.webm?t=1760038553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632890?t=1760038553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/1da18319f4b701dca8ce326dd335240df0fb6bbd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760038553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/8a37c33295c441ed23a318b0c9fddf6fb8f8870e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760038553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/8a37c33295c441ed23a318b0c9fddf6fb8f8870e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760038553","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains instances of killing in a fictional war scenario, characters curse/swear throughout the story and there are light/soft references to sex, abuse and other mature and dark themes."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Livestream Legend!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Content King</i>, you step into the shoes of Caden Brentley, an aspiring young content creator who\u2019s taken livestreaming to the extreme: broadcasting his entire life. With the goal of becoming the biggest streamer of all time, you must pursue clout by any means necessary. Interact with characters, start drama with streamers, complete quests, and stir up mischief to boost your view count and climb the ranks of internet fame.   <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/7a56c80a6111ed0bdb22ce8ee3cdb3bc.poster.avif?t=1760038553\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/7a56c80a6111ed0bdb22ce8ee3cdb3bc.webm?t=1760038553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/7a56c80a6111ed0bdb22ce8ee3cdb3bc.mp4?t=1760038553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact with Everybody!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless characters voiced by real streamers, every interaction brings new drama, new dialogue, and new choices. Will you help them\u2026 or simply use them for content?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/d32b054f829a447ca27515d5ad4ac5d8.poster.avif?t=1760038553\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632890/extras/d32b054f829a447ca27515d5ad4ac5d8.webm?t=1760038553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything\u2019s Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of minigames and explore an open sandbox world. In <i>Content King</i>, everything is an opportunity to entertain the chat and get new viewers!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c